              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='200' forceUpdate='true' h='20800' id='6' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='99000' x='500' y='78400'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Key Findings &amp; Solution Proposition</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>93%</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'> reported construction costs higher than their initial estimate.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>41%</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'> faced unexpected/unplanned expenses, while </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>70%</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'> found budget control difficult.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>87%</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'> showed willingness to use a reliable cost-estimation tool.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Solution: Smart Construction Cost Estimation &amp; Planning Tool</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>A tool that creates a </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>realistic pre-construction budget</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'> by combining </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>material prices, labour costs, contractor quotations, and planned requirements</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>, while adding </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>contingency for unexpected expenses</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>. It can also provide </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>budget-vs-actual tracking and alerts</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'> during construction.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>The findings indicate that the core challenge is not simply tracking expenses, but </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>getting a reliable estimate and accounting for unexpected costs before construction begins</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>. The </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>87% stated willingness to use</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'> such a tool provides initial validation for this solution direction.</run>
